From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mtbl23 <mbhangal23@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:09:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf port: read the query box once in entity slice queries

ChunkEntitySlices#getEntities and #getEntitiesLimited called
AABB#intersects(AABB) per candidate entity, re-reading the query box fields
each time. The six query fields are now read once per call and compared with
the same strict comparisons (so the answer is identical, NaN included).
LivingEntity#isAlive checks the plain `dead` flag first; the three tests have
no side effects so the result is unchanged.

Adapted from Leaf "Optimise getEntities" by Taiyou06 <kaandindar21@gmail.com>,
co-authored by Martijn Muijsers <martijnmuijsers@live.nl> (MIT).
Leaf: https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/level/entity/ChunkEntitySlices.java b/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/level/entity/ChunkEntitySlices.java
index 2b29b3593ae8f355803122381b9e42ed0cf1914b..8f6c72dcb087e83297bdfe44c51183993be5f5a5 100644
